    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT GAME</h2><strong>Are you drunk? Then go home.</strong><br><br>I get drunk when I drink!<br>I feel good when I drink!<br>I feel good when I'm drunk?<br><br>When you are drunk, your cerebral and cerebellum are paralyzed, and your cerebral neocortex function is reduced, thereby suppressing your reason. <br><br>drunk lightly -&gt; feel good<br>drunk Moderately  -&gt; instincts become harder to control.<br>drunk extremely -&gt; memory, reason disappear. <br><br>After being completely intoxicated, will my body be able to go home safely with only my instincts left?<br><br>Even if you are drunk and unconscious, you can go home with your instincts.<br>A platform game that reaches its final destination at the risk of returning to its starting point in case of a mistake.<br><br>Players must steer a drunk person home safely. In the process, they must start all over again, falling down. It consists of a single stage, can't be saved, and there are no checkpoints.",
